        "key": "ChrEv_2630_005_01_023",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_2630_005_01:ChrEv_2630_005_01_023:5493151f",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_2630_005_01:ChrEv_2630_005_01_023:5493151f",
        "jp_sha256": "aea6c39a5ca378bcda3da668fe6252b5f26374fdb59f6c60bd20ed05179dea63",
        "official_en_sha256": "1ba9b641f73aedcf5b701dba501cc5453734814650378393e7aad752f681bff6"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "「帝国の盾」だったヴィルヘルム将軍も、\r\nきっとそれを望むはずです。",
        "official_en": "I am sure General Wilhelm, the “Shield of the Empire,” would not have wanted it any other way.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
