    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_2630_005_01:ChrEv_2630_005_01_004:fbdb66b1",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_ChrEv_2630_005_01",
        "key": "ChrEv_2630_005_01_004",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_2630_005_01:ChrEv_2630_005_01_004:fbdb66b1",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_2630_005_01:ChrEv_2630_005_01_004:fbdb66b1",
        "jp_sha256": "9f92d42e86b23ef24262c439b4f28e234cc5eb493ba5128e0410fd53eeed2eae",
        "official_en_sha256": "6c62a464b22ca439d9c8c8a345bc56da6350d744a1aee02f7a9684d68d2f31e5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ええ、ドルフォクシータイムズって\r\n知ってるでしょ？\r\nあれを発行しているのは私よ。",
        "official_en": "Well, I certainly like to think I am <text style=\"italic\">a</> journalist. I’m the publisher of the Drofox Gazette. I’m sure you’ve heard of it?",
        "real_en": "Yes, you’ve heard of <text style=\"italic\">The Drofox Gazette</>, haven’t you? I’m the one who publishes it."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
