        "official_en_sha256": "a75f22dc9d4b0fe87f775e638b11bbcd288c4d2e0519d0e1b0065a367319ba48"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "このクリスタルはそのために使ってほしい。",
        "official_en": "If this crystal can be of use to you on your journey, then it should be yours.",
        "real_en": "I want you to use this crystal for that purpose."
      },
      "review": {
