      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ヴィルヘルム将軍の汚名はすすげましたが、\r\n私にとってはこれが始まりです。",
        "official_en": "General Wilhelm’s honor has been restored, and his story has come to a close, but my own journey has only just begun.",
